{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2021-04-14 10:30:00', 'title': 'CATERPILLAR INC. MAINTAINS DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL., APRIL 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) VOTED TODAY TO\xa0MAINTAIN\xa0THE QUARTERLY\xa0CASH DIVIDEND\xa0OF\xa0ONE DOLLAR AND THREE CENTS ($1.03) PER SHARE OF\xa0COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE\xa0ON MAY 20,\xa02021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT\xa0THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0APRIL 26, 2021.'}